{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_5ECB566A","title":"Ava congratulates you","entry":"Dlg_5ECB566A::entry","exit":"Dlg_5ECB566A::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_0BAFA647","articyId":"72057624102718567","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Two business licenses. Soon you will own the whole city.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Two business licenses. Soon you will own the whole city.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":825.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30857","byteOffset":19555264,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_3BE27692","articyId":"72057624102718593","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Only a little. Congratulations on your expansion. I believe good things will follow. Mostly.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Only a little. Congratulations on your expansion. I believe good things will follow. Mostly.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1425.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32795","byteOffset":20291192,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_81E4C6A8","articyId":"72057645577628901","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I love your confidence.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I love your confidence.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1425.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18296","byteOffset":14808592,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_FDE71EFC","articyId":"72057645577628918","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I have another suggestion.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I have another suggestion.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3475.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49031","byteOffset":32889408,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_5B54D69F","articyId":"72057645577628932","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"If your entrepreneurial empire expands, which I think is now likely, you will need an advisor. Someone canny. Someone who knows their way around the city, and how to run a business. Or at least, how to maintain one.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If your entrepreneurial empire expands, which I think is now likely, you will need an advisor. Someone canny. Someone who knows their way around the city, and how to run a business. Or at least, how to maintain one.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4075.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46452","byteOffset":31907712,"byteLength":596}},{"id":"DFr_A4C035AD","articyId":"72057645577628965","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"My help is assumed. No, you need someone who is more tuned to this part of the city. Someone with more... human instincts. I suggest Banor.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"My help is assumed. No, you need someone who is more tuned to this part of the city. Someone with more... human instincts. I suggest Banor.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4675.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30564","byteOffset":19442848,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_594A9857","articyId":"72057645577628973","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Banor. He knows this part of the city, has good connections, is loyal to Thaddeus (and therefore you), and he would not ask for a percentage. Just a salary.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Banor. He knows this part of the city, has good connections, is loyal to Thaddeus (and therefore you), and he would not ask for a percentage. Just a salary.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4675.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36696","byteOffset":28226192,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_90D6B8E3","articyId":"72057645577628979","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Good help saves money. And I know who could offer good help... and he's cheap.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Good help saves money. And I know who could offer good help... and he's cheap.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4975.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41185","byteOffset":29908352,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_1F6C2FB1","articyId":"72057645577628995","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I have already asked him to meet you. If he does not work out, you may dock my salary.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I have already asked him to meet you. If he does not work out, you may dock my salary.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5275